<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Model Performance · Smart Crop</title>
        <a href="/logout">🚪 Logout{% if user %} ({{ user.name }}){% endif %}</a>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,700&family=Nunito+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --green: #14382a; --green2: #1d4a37; --wheat: #e6b64a;
      --bg: #f3f5f2; --card: #ffffff; --text: #1b2a22; --muted: #6b7a72; --line: #e7ebe8;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; font-family: 'Nunito Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); }

    /* ---------- Sidebar ---------- */
    .side { position: fixed; inset: 0 auto 0 0; width: 230px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0f2c20, #14382a);
            color: #fff; padding: 24px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .brand .logo { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--wheat);
                   display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 22px; }
    .brand b { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.15; }
    .nav a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: #cfe0d6; text-decoration: none;
             padding: 11px 12px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
    .nav a:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); color: #fff; }
    .nav a.active { background: var(--wheat); color: var(--green); }
    .side .foot { margin-top: auto; font-size: 12px; opacity: .6; line-height: 1.5; }

    /* ---------- Main ---------- */
    .main { margin-left: 230px; padding: 28px 30px 40px; }
    .head h1 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 30px; margin: 0; color: var(--green); }
    .head p { margin: 4px 0 24px; color: var(--muted); }

    .kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .kpi { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px;
           display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
    .ico { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 22px; flex: none; }
    .i1 { background: #e3f1e8; } .i2 { background: #fbf0d3; } .i3 { background: #e2ecf8; } .i4 { background: #f6e3e3; }
    .kpi small { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }
    .kpi b { display: block; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 24px; color: var(--green); margin-top: 2px; }

    .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .card h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: var(--green); }
    .card .sub { margin: 2px 0 14px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .card img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .narrow { max-width: 760px; }
    .empty { color: var(--muted); padding: 30px 0; text-align: center; }

    .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
    .row .card { margin-bottom: 20px; }

    .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; }
    th { text-align: left; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px;
         padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }
    td { padding: 11px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    .pill { background: #e3f1e8; color: var(--green); font-weight: 800; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; margin-left: 8px; }
    .bar { display: inline-block; width: 110px; height: 7px; background: #e9eeea; border-radius: 99px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
    .bar span { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--green2); border-radius: 99px; }

    .why { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .why li { display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); line-height: 1.5; }
    .why li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .why .n { flex: none; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--wheat); color: var(--green);
              font-weight: 800; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px; }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .side { position: static; width: auto; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;
              gap: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; }
      .brand { margin: 0 12px 0 0; }
      .nav { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .nav a { margin: 0; padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 14px; }
      .side .foot { display: none; }
      .main { margin-left: 0; padding: 20px 14px 30px; }
      .head h1 { font-size: 26px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <aside class="side">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">🌾</div>
      <b>Smart Crop<br>Advisor</b>
    </div>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="/">🏠 Home</a>
      <a href="/dashboard">📊 Dashboard</a>
      <a href="/history">🕘 History</a>
      <a href="/performance" class="active">📈 Performance</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="foot">Flask &middot; Random Forest<br>22 crops &middot; 7 inputs</div>
  </aside>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="head">
      <h1>Model Performance</h1>
      <p>How well the Random Forest model works compared with four other algorithms</p>
    </div>

    <section class="kpis">
      <div class="kpi"><div class="ico i1">🏆</div>
        <div><small>Selected model</small><b>Random Forest</b></div></div>
      <div class="kpi"><div class="ico i2">🎯</div>
        <div><small>Test accuracy</small><b>99.55%</b></div></div>
      <div class="kpi"><div class="ico i3">🧪</div>
        <div><small>Train / Test split</small><b>80 / 20</b></div></div>
      <div class="kpi"><div class="ico i4">🌱</div>
        <div><small>Crops / Inputs</small><b>22 / 7</b></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Algorithm comparison</h2>
      <p class="sub">Accuracy on 20% unseen test data</p>
      <div class="scroll">
        <table>
          <tr><th>Rank</th><th>Algorithm</th><th>Accuracy</th></tr>
          <tr><td>1</td><td><b>Random Forest</b><span class="pill">Selected</span></td>
              <td><span class="bar"><span style="width:99.55%"></span></span>99.55%</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2</td><td>Naive Bayes</td>
              <td><span class="bar"><span style="width:99.55%"></span></span>99.55%</td></tr>
          <tr><td>3</td><td>SVM</td>
              <td><span class="bar"><span style="width:98.41%"></span></span>98.41%</td></tr>
          <tr><td>4</td><td>Decision Tree</td>
              <td><span class="bar"><span style="width:97.95%"></span></span>97.95%</td></tr>
          <tr><td>5</td><td>KNN</td>
              <td><span class="bar"><span style="width:97.95%"></span></span>97.95%</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    {% for title, file in charts %}
    {% if loop.index == 2 %}
    <section class="card">
    {% else %}
    <section class="card narrow">
    {% endif %}
      <h2>{{ title }}</h2>
      {% if loop.index == 1 %}
      <p class="sub">Five algorithms on the same test data. Random Forest is highlighted.</p>
      {% elif loop.index == 2 %}
      <p class="sub">Rows are actual crops, columns are predicted crops. A bright diagonal means almost every prediction is correct.</p>
      {% else %}
      <p class="sub">Which soil and weather input the model depends on most.</p>
      {% endif %}
      <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename=file) }}" alt="{{ title }}">
    </section>
    {% else %}
    <section class="card"><p class="empty">No charts found.<br>Run <code>python compare_models.py</code> first.</p></section>
    {% endfor %}

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Why Random Forest?</h2>
      <p class="sub"></p>
      <ul class="why">
        <li><span class="n">1</span><div>Highest accuracy (99.55%) and stable results, because it combines many decision trees.</div></li>
        <li><span class="n">2</span><div>Gives feature importance, so we can show which input matters most.</div></li>
        <li><span class="n">3</span><div>Gives prediction probabilities, which power the confidence % and the top-3 crop options.</div></li>
        <li><span class="n">4</span><div>Handles noisy data and different value ranges without feature scaling.</div></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
